MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository (https://github.com/matheusbgodoi/local-studio) is a MODIFIED
fork of that work, maintained by Matheus Barboza de Godoi. It is not the upstream
project and is not endorsed by it.

Modifications are Copyright 2026 Matheus Barboza de Godoi and are licensed under
the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

As required by section 4(b) of the License, the changed files carry prominent
notices stating that they were changed. Rather than repeat a header in every
file, the complete list is kept here and in the Git history of this fork, which
records every change with its author and date.

The fork diverges from upstream in five areas:

1. CONTROLLER IDENTITY
   The app is pointed at a private RTX 3090 host over a Tailscale network. Chat,
   the model catalogue, Status and Usage all share that one controller identity.

2. STATUS AND USAGE TELEMETRY
   The Status and Usage pages read live host telemetry. Usage was rebuilt around
   three tabs — Tokens, Energy and Efficiency — with cache-aware token semantics,
   measured GPU board energy, coverage accounting, and cost derived from a
   user-configured electricity tariff.
   Added: frontend/src/features/usage/{activity-heatmap.tsx, energy-preferences.ts,
   energy-settings.tsx, usage-efficiency-tab.tsx, usage-energy-tab.tsx,
   usage-formatters.ts, usage-panels.tsx, usage-tokens-tab.tsx},
   docs/status-and-usage.md.
   Modified: controller/contracts/usage.ts, frontend/src/features/usage/*,
   frontend/src/lib/api/system.ts, frontend/src/lib/types.ts.

3. WEB SEARCH AND BROWSING
   A keyless browser_search tool, reader-first page reading, conservative
   challenge detection, and a human-verification path that hands a protected page
   to the operator instead of attempting any automated bypass.
   Added: services/agent-runtime/src/browser-host/{search.ts, challenge.ts},
   services/agent-runtime/test/browser-*.test.ts, docs/web-search.md.
   Modified: services/agent-runtime/src/browser-host/{browser-host.ts,
   playwright.ts, reader.ts}, services/agent-runtime/src/http/browser-handlers.ts,
   frontend/desktop/resources/pi-extensions/browser.ts,
   frontend/desktop/resources/skills/browser/SKILL.md,
   frontend/src/features/agent/ui/timeline/tool-block-view.tsx.

4. PERSONAL MCP CONNECTORS AND SKILLS
   Connectors are armed per chat session rather than per installation, and skills
   load on demand, so a fresh session carries neither in its tool schemas.
   Added: frontend/src/app/api/agent/connectors/session/route.ts,
   frontend/src/features/agent/composer/{mcp-commands.ts,
   skill-invocation-commands.ts}, frontend/src/features/agent/tools/
   connector-session-api.ts, frontend/src/features/agent/workspace/
   thinking-level-preference.ts.

5. UPDATE POLICY
   The desktop application never downloads or installs an upstream release
   artefact over this customised build. It still reports that a newer upstream
   release exists.
   Added: docs/upstream-updates.md.
   Modified: frontend/desktop/logic/update-manager.ts.

